DE:
Wie, was? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Seit wann ich gärtnere?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Ich gärtnere überhaupt nicht!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Männer gärtnern nicht.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Männer betreiben Landschaftskunst.
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
Plants won't stab you in the back.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
They'll always be there for you,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Well, except for those fancy plants
with the thorns, {{TAG:0003:0006:}}but even then you'd
have to fall backward onto them.

FR:
Les plantes ne te trahissent pas.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Elles ne te font jamais de mal,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Enfin, sauf celles avec des épines,
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}et encore, il faudrait leur marcher
dessus pieds nus !

IT:
Le piante sono creature fedeli.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Non ti... pianteranno mai in asso!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0003:0001:}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
Do you like working in the dirt?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
There isn't an animal out there
who doesn't!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!

FR:
Tu aimes travailler dans la boue ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
C'est le « propre » des animaux, si
je puis dire !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}HA HA HA !

ES:
Estar rodeado de plantas
es de lo más relajante,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
Je me sens vraiment à l'aise quand
je suis entouré par des plantes,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

Tu dois vraiment aimer les plantes
pour venir ici de si loin !{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

DE:
Du kommst extra zu uns, um dich
mit Gartenbedarf einzudecken?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Du gefällst mir,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
Did this shop have the flower or
whatever you were looking for?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

IT:
Hai trovato il fiore che cercavi?
Ah, non cercavi un fiore,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
